  "label": "User projected onto the chaotic vehicle scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity of the dilapidated, mismatched truck (chaotic_vehicle_scene) as a metaphor for 'this transgendershit is getting outta hand'. The meme uses the visual material to represent the user's own frustration or anger, implying the user is the one who feels overwhelmed or out of control by the situation described in the text. The projection is implicit, not explicit with deictic pronouns, but the user is positioned as the experiencer of the chaos depicted.",
